{
  "about": "v2 added the cases marked \"added\": \"v2\", for the shapes, with other products than the eval: dev_jade_bottle now wants the cap drawn (gold), not listed as unsupported. Dev sentences for designing the grounding tables and prompt (Phase 3). They are deliberately different from the frozen eval sentences in cases.json, and use other products and colours where possible, so tuning on them doesn't tune on the eval. Same check types as cases.json.",
